   "value": "<p><em>Shadow Killer — Cursed Technique Reversal, 3rd level</em></p><p>At 3rd level, while within 10 ft of a bound creature you can spend 2 cursed energy as a bonus action to attempt to break their bindings. Make a Cursed Energy check against the DC of their bindings. On a success, you destroy the bindings with your shadow. You can use this as a full-turn action (Action + Bonus Action + Movement) to gain advantage on the check.</p>",
